# ==============================================================================
# GOING LIVE WITH PETPOOJA (only 3 steps — no code changes)
# 1. Paste the merchant key set from the Petpooja panel into the FUNCTIONS env
#    (Netlify Site settings → Environment variables, or firebase functions config):
#      PETPOOJA_APP_KEY="..."
#      PETPOOJA_APP_SECRET="..."
#      PETPOOJA_ACCESS_TOKEN="..."
#    (Optional overrides: PETPOOJA_ORDERS_BASE, PETPOOJA_MENU_BASE.)
# 2. Redeploy the Cloud Functions API with those variables set.
# 3. Set VITE_PETPOOJA_ENABLED=true above and redeploy this client.
# Without the flag (default) the app runs fully on the offline mock gateway.
# ==============================================================================

